priv/static/world-110m.json is the Natural Earth 1:110m cultural
countries dataset, which is in the public domain.

https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

world-atlas 2.0.2 (https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas, ISC,
Mike Bostock) converts that dataset to TopoJSON. The JSON file is
loaded at runtime from the application origin. It is not inlined
into priv/static/serviceradar_ui.js.
